2. What the scripts process (third-party material, not part of this package)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
The scripts read, convert and compress model weights of EMAGE (audio-driven
holistic co-speech gesture generation) from the PantoMatrix project:

  * Weights   : Hugging Face model H-Liu1997/emage_audio
                https://huggingface.co/H-Liu1997/emage_audio
                License on the model card metadata: Apache-2.0
                (checked 2026-10-03; revision b04466b83bdebd656844a2c416797d3131e34ede)
  * Training data of the model: BEAT2
                https://huggingface.co/datasets/H-Liu1997/BEAT2
                License on the dataset card metadata: Apache-2.0 (checked 2026-10-03)
  * Model code: https://github.com/PantoMatrix/PantoMatrix (commit 0bbb03d is
                extracted at export time into packages/emage-onnx/.cache, never
                redistributed by this package). The root of that repository has
                NO LICENSE file (checked 2026-10-03 on a local clone), so the
                license of the code is not clearly stated.
  * Project pages: https://pantomatrix.github.io/EMAGE/ , https://pantomatrix.github.io/BEAT/
  * EMAGE paper  : https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.00374

The baseline ONNX files that the scripts read for the vq_*_idx and postprocess
models (emage-onnx-export/onnx/*.onnx) come from
https://github.com/VolgaGerm/emage-onnx-export , MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 VolgaGerm. The vq_*_idx_int8.onnx and postprocess_int8.onnx
files in out/final are derived from those exports.

