4. Modifications made to the EMAGE weights by this package's scripts
--------------------------------------------------------------------
  * export wrapper: a body-only copy of EmageAudioModel.forward that outputs
    only cls_upper / cls_hands / cls_lower (face branch and in-graph seed chain
    removed; the seed is computed on the host);
  * removal of cross-attention layers 0..3 of audio_motion_cross_attn (no
    retraining; step 3);
  * INT8 dynamic quantization of MatMul and INT8 weight-only quantization of
    Conv (steps 1 and 2);
  * offline ONNX Runtime graph optimization (ORT_ENABLE_EXTENDED) of the final
    files (step 3), and optionally conversion to ORT format.
The resulting files are NOT identical to the upstream weights and produce
outputs that differ from them (see README.md for the measured differences).

